tion powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n           这个批次的处理方式是鲜果先做24小时的有氧发酵，接下来脱皮后再做48小时的厌氧发酵后清洗果胶晾晒，它是我们在售卖的瑰夏里面偏莓果调的一只，口感也是醇厚。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n           关于\n           <span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            Paola Trujillo与伯尼托庄园\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           //以下资料源自生豆商Fresh Farmer网站\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          我（Paola）出生在位于哥伦比亚考卡省北部美丽而小巧的咖啡天堂 Pescador，我在新鲜烘焙的咖啡香气和宁静的自然环境中成长。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          我是幸运的人，因为我有最有爱最可爱的家人；我妈妈教我分享知识的价值，我爸爸给我机会与咖啡“我的生活项目”一起工作，我姐姐给我一个每天醒来的理由，她教我真爱的价值。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkc7MIyzMGFIEYsPhVU753ywib4eSqQBerGsgiav3pm1uCHPrKEvc1FvIaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          我去了马尼萨莱斯的国立大学学习化学工程师，一开始那是一段艰难的经历，因为那是远离家人的时间。毕业后我在肥皂厂工作了几个月，此时我有一个很大的困惑，我不喜欢我的工作，不知道我的人生目标是什么，然后我决定回到我的家。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          就在这一刻，祖母去世，父亲非常难过，我提议在当年采摘季开始管理农场。我从没想过这个提议会改变我的生活。渐渐地我了解了农场的日常工作，我认识了更多邀请我去他们农场的邻居，并给了我许多在Patio Bonito庄园的技术及经验建议。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkcGFA97XgFMbZqTrL3IniaqBKFBVcPQ6paTehHcs2pcgNXFK397vBWoGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          开始的第一年是一场灾难，因为当年的价格非常低，咖啡的质量也很差，我们选择“Reinvent Patio Bonito”，就像精品咖啡一样，我们开始做一些小的改变，我们结识了很多咖啡朋友们，他们已经和我们在一起9年了，帮助我们提高了咖啡的质量。在七年半的时间里，我与众多出口商合作，当我开始与他们合作时，我确信我可以改变其他咖啡家庭的生活，因为我经历了农场的变化，并在它的帮助下获取了积极的结果。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkckZL9iaezPibLBdMFYQgDoqTx44Jgcfjr7VB89icrEaibib9icoFu47ERGKGA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          我有机会与考卡、慧兰和娜玲珑的许多咖啡农合作、分享经验、和他们一起学习，一起成长真是太好了。他们给了我热爱我的工作最重要的理由，每次见面我都有一个新的机会来激励一起工作的咖啡农，以可持续发展的理念进行生产和提升质量。我很高兴，因为我为销售咖啡提供了新的视角，我在他们的眼中看到了为家人带来更好福祉的希望，这种感觉是无价的。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkcZ5y1pzSp4UWNje0Ix58CImj0NnuL180eToYNM8OicJOibwHZ0cGgOZ5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          四个月前，我回到了农场，因为我想加强Patio Bonito庄园的流程和质量。作为一个咖啡家族，我们的愿景是提供高品质、透明、可追溯的咖啡，最重要的是用满满的爱来制作。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
